<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine grain/oilseed stocks on December 1.</title>
<headline>Argentine grain/oilseed stocks on December 1.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat figures for domestic grain stocks on December 1 in tonnes, followed by figures for a month earlier and a year earlier:</p>
<p> Bread wheat    2,543,083	   676,337	   844,046</p>
<p> Maize	    1,189,705	 1,557,804	   934,903</p>
<p> Sorghum	     98,882	   119,642	    53,031</p>
<p> Barley	     172,997	    96,337	   101,760</p>
</text>
